,{"id":"2312695","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"圣诞节当天，阿淼和大树去了电影院。电影结束后，大树的惊喜让阿淼不由自主地……另一边，冬冬为了取悦伊万，举办了一场盛大的圣诞派对……","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"2312696","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"新人女性编辑银子加入了金主的公司。她立刻跟着金主去跑采访，但过于紧凑的行程让她疲惫不堪。当晚，金主编对银子说的话，让银子脑海中充满了某个重要的回忆……","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"2312697","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"金主编为了介绍新人编辑银子，来到了大树家。在大家面前紧张的银子，阿淼察觉到了她身上的某个特征……","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"2312698","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"春节期间，大树带着阿淼回到了奶奶所在的福利院。一边帮忙干活，一边回想起在福利院度过的童年时光。另一边，奶奶对阿淼说“好久不见啊，过得好吗？”……","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"2312699","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"幼年时期的阿淼曾对人类抱有厌恶感。在被人类孩子们欺负时，一个少年救了他，但阿淼却不由自主地抓伤了那个少年的脸。阿淼察觉到了那个少年温柔却又悲伤的独特气息……","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"2312701","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"小时候的大树曾深信“没有人需要自己”。某天，他帮助了一只被